efdd9baf0bdf7a5aab","document_id":"doc_01m4gcq87e5k9e321mrzfz2y6h","page":3,"ordinal":14,"kind":"paragraph","section":"Our approach to climate change","text":"The Board's Sustainability Committee oversees climate-related risks and opportunities and reviews progress against our decarbonisation roadmap twice a year. Climate performance is included in the annual bonus scorecard for executive directors.","bbox":[72.5,124.2,499.5,170.1],"extraction_method":"text","confidence":1.0,"table_ref":null,"cells":null,"document":{"id":"doc_01m4gcq87e5k9e321mrzfz2y6h","title":"Aldermere Materials Group \u2014 Sustainability Report 2025","short_name":"Sustainability report FY2025","version":1,"doc_type":"sustainability_report","period_label":"FY2025","page_sizes":[[595.0,842.0],[595.0,842.0],[595.0,842.0],[595.0,842.0],[595.0,842.0],[595.0,842.0],[595.0,842.0]],"superseded_at":null}}},{"role":"related","element_keys":[],"note":"Related passage for review","score":0.342,"passage":{"id":"ev_2c7a41045e61ada62bf8","document_id":"doc_01m4gcq87e5k9e321mrzfz2y6h","page":4,"ordinal":22,"kind":"paragraph","section":"Greenhouse gas emissions \u203a Methodology","text":"We calculate emissions in accordance with the GHG Protocol Corporate Standard. Emission factors are taken from the UK Government GHG Conversion Factors for Company Reporting (DESNZ, 2025), and global warming potentials from the IPCC Sixth Assessment Report (AR6). Our inventory includes carbon dioxide (CO2), methane (CH4) and nitrous oxide (N2O); emissions of other greenhouse gases are not material.","bbox":[72.5,151.3,509.0,227.7],"extraction_method":"text","confidence":1.0,"table_ref":null,"cells":null,"document":{"id":"doc_01m4gcq87e5k9e321mrzfz2y6h","title":"Aldermere Materials Group \u2014 Sustainability Report 2025","short_name":"Sustainability report FY2025","version":1,"doc_type":"sustainability_report","period_label":"FY2025","page_sizes":[[595.0,842.0],[595.0,842.0],[595.0,842.0],[595.0,842.0],[595.0,842.0],[595.0,842